Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.39,0:00:26.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf, Dokter Mao.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.15,0:00:29.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi dia bilang jika aku melakukan ini,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.15,0:00:32.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,dia akan mengajariku\Ncara mengendalikan monster itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.57,0:00:36.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maksudmu Hakubi?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.78,0:00:39.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mari kita uji
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.91,0:00:41.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan lihat sebaik apa jarumnya bekerja.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.16,0:00:44.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mao! Bunuh Hyakka!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.89,0:00:57.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mao!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.80,0:00:59.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa dia dimantrai?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.39,0:01:00.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Nanoka, lari.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.22,0:01:03.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mao!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.68,0:01:04.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bodoh! Nanoka!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.06,0:01:06.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami bilang lari!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.70,0:01:18.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jarum bonekanya…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.32,0:01:20.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mao…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.78,0:01:22.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sadarlah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.01,0:01:37.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nanoka…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.22,0:01:39.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Syukurlah…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.68,0:01:44.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hakubi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.53,0:01:58.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sial! Dia kabur!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.87,0:02:01.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mao berengsek itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.04,0:02:05.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa dia sengaja hanya mengincarku?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.29,0:02:07.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Menyedihkan sekali.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.46,0:02:10.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf aku tidak banyak membantu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.63,0:02:12.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Justru tidak.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.88,0:02:14.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau cukup hebat untuk pertarungan pertamamu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.76,0:02:18.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Teruslah berusaha.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.26,0:02:20.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baik!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.48,0:03:58.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aduh…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.48,0:03:59.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ah… Maaf…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.78,0:04:02.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begini… Hyakka…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.20,0:04:05.32,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Apa aku
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.49,0:04:07.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,yang melakukan ini kepadamu?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.58,0:04:11.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan khawatir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.50,0:04:13.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah kuduga.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.63,0:04:17.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rupanya aku yang menyakitimu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.34,0:04:20.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maafkan aku.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.30,0:04:21.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku lengah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.30,0:04:23.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Orang yang menusukmu dengan jarum
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.97,0:04:26.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,adalah Soma, bukan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.51,0:04:27.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Atas perintah Hakubi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.14,0:04:30.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya. Sayang sekali
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.77,0:04:33.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku tak bisa menyelamatkannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.06,0:04:36.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu saja?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.61,0:04:39.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa kau tak marah padanya?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.19,0:04:41.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nanoka.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.69,0:04:42.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau sudah bangun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.15,0:04:45.78,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Dia benar-benar mengkhianatimu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.03,0:04:48.74,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Nona Nanoka sangat marah soal itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.83,0:04:50.41,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Tentu!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.49,0:04:52.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Setelah semua yang kau lakukan\Nuntuk membantunya,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.66,0:04:54.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,perbuatan Soma kepadamu…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.83,0:04:55.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.08,0:04:58.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tampaknya hasrat Soma terhadap monster itu
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.67,0:05:01.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,jauh lebih kuat daripada dugaanku.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.51,0:05:05.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku juga berutang maaf kepadamu, Nanoka.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.22,0:05:08.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dengar, kau tak perlu minta maaf, Mao!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.89,0:05:09.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aduh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.93,0:05:10.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nanoka.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.64,0:05:13.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku terluka saat menghentikan Mao.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.36,0:05:24.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mungkin beberapa tulang rusuknya patah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.11,0:05:27.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak. Tak ada yang patah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.82,0:05:28.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.24,0:05:31.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena aku merasakan cedera apa pun\Nsaat kau tidak sadarkan diri.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.00,0:05:34.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dadaku?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.33,0:05:37.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.71,0:05:39.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu pemeriksaan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.13,0:05:40.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pemeriksaan medis!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.13,0:05:43.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hyakka! Kau juga melihatnya?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.26,0:05:44.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tak melihat apa pun, Bodoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.13,0:05:47.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami menunggu di luar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.01,0:05:50.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu, kurasa tidak apa-apa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.64,0:05:51.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa maksudmu?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.25,0:06:20.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gawat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.38,0:06:21.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pasien itu hilang lagi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.67,0:06:26.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pasien itu
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.05,0:06:28.93,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,menyelinap keluar dari kamarnya setiap malam,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.01,0:06:30.51,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,sejak dia dirawat di rumah sakit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.09,0:06:33.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mungkin dia hanya benci\Nberada di rumah sakit?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.06,0:06:37.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tampaknya dia punya masalah mata
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.39,0:06:40.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan tidak bisa berjalan sendiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.73,0:06:42.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.07,0:06:45.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, itu sebabnya perawat itu\Nmeminta bantuanmu?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.57,0:06:48.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya. Saat pagi tiba,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.49,0:06:51.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,dia bilang entah bagaimana\Npasien itu kembali ke kamarnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.16,0:06:54.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dan dia selalu berlumuran lumpur.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.99,0:06:56.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lumpur?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.25,0:06:58.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Artinya dia di luar?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.92,0:07:02.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, Tenko, siapa pria itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.88,0:07:04.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dokter Mao.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.38,0:07:06.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau sudah dengar
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.46,0:07:10.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,tentang penyembuh spiritual\Nyang dibunuh bulan lalu?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.51,0:07:13.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya. Ada di koran.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.60,0:07:16.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tampaknya, tempat itu dirampok.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.52,0:07:19.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak ada bukti,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.10,0:07:22.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi ada rumor bahwa pria ini pembunuhnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.27,0:07:24.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pasien ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.36,0:07:32.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sekali lagi, dia belum makan sesuap pun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.91,0:07:34.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak sekali pun sejak dia dirawat?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.16,0:07:39.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Belum, dia belum menyentuh\Nmakanan rumah sakit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.58,0:07:41.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mungkinkah dia makan di luar?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.21,0:07:44.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi di sekitar sini
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.50,0:07:48.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,tidak ada tempat untuk makan,\Napalagi rumah atau ladang.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.42,0:07:52.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu membuatku merinding.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.46,0:08:32.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada semacam kabut di sekeliling.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.38,0:08:34.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu penghalang.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.39,0:08:38.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, pria itu dikendalikan\Noleh semacam mantra?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.52,0:08:40.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.64,0:08:41.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini meresahkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.31,0:08:44.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kasus perampokan-pembunuhan\Npenyembuh spiritual
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.69,0:08:45.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan lumpur itu…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.33,0:09:00.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tunggu, kuburan?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.05,0:09:12.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa? Dia makan tanah kuburan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.22,0:09:16.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini kutukan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.78,0:09:33.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa yang dia lakukan?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.36,0:09:35.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku juga tidak tahu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.61,0:09:39.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi kutukan sekuat ini,\Ndigabungkan dengan sihir Tanah…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.99,0:09:43.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hanya satu orang yang bisa melakukan ini\Ndi zaman sekarang.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.80,0:09:59.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mao.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.30,0:10:02.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu Natsuno?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.97,0:10:04.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah kuduga. Natsuno.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.31,0:10:09.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.27,0:10:11.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa yang kau lakukan kepada pria ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.61,0:10:15.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siapa pria ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.90,0:10:18.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa dia dimantrai?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.12,0:10:22.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf mengecewakanmu, Mao,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.16,0:10:25.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi ini bukan mantraku.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.66,0:10:29.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lalu siapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.59,0:10:39.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sangat lelah…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.68,0:10:41.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Natsuno.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.01,0:10:45.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagaimana perasaanmu?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.02,0:10:48.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh… Masago…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.90,0:10:51.69,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Aku membawa herba obat
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.77,0:10:53.36,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,dari kebun Kamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.23,0:10:55.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terima kasih.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.90,0:10:58.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini obat yang meningkatkan sirkulasi darah?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.28,0:11:04.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Masago sangat baik.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.87,0:11:08.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi ini tidak akan menyembuhkanku.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.01,0:11:18.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa kau kemari, Natsuno?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.05,0:11:20.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begini…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.26,0:11:22.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Belakangan ini,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.01,0:11:26.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku melihat tanah aneh\Nbeterbangan di udara setiap malam.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.10,0:11:29.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pria ini
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.39,0:11:32.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,makan tanah kuburan dan memuntahkannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.98,0:11:37.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kutukan macam apa ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.25,0:11:50.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siap mengejar mereka, Mao?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.87,0:11:52.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nanoka! Otoya!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.50,0:11:53.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bawa dia ke rumah sakit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.92,0:11:56.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sial… Sial!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.30,0:11:59.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, ada apa dengan pria itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.42,0:12:01.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada sesuatu yang kudengar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.34,0:12:05.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pria itu dikabarkan\Nsebagai pelaku perampokan
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.60,0:12:07.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan pembunuhan penyembuh spiritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.81,0:12:10.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, maksudmu\Npenyembuh spiritual mengutuknya
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.98,0:12:12.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,dengan napas terakhirnya?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.15,0:12:17.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sialan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.40,0:12:19.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bajingan itu… Beraninya dia…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.86,0:12:21.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Sialan!\N- Harap tenang.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.40,0:12:23.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bajingan itu! Sial!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.16,0:12:24.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ucapannya kasar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.67,0:12:38.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sepertinya kita beruntung.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.09,0:12:42.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini pasti aula sembahyang\Npenyembuh spiritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.56,0:12:49.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tanah?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.78,0:13:00.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Natsuno!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.53,0:13:06.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Berhenti!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.57,0:13:09.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aura Tanahnya menghilang.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.24,0:13:11.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.91,0:13:13.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa yang terjadi?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.64,0:13:36.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siapa di sana?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.96,0:13:56.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau sudah bangun, Natsuno?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.08,0:13:58.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.67,0:14:00.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tanah yang kita lihat tadi…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.42,0:14:03.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pasti ada penyihir di balik ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.92,0:14:04.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.55,0:14:08.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Haruskah kita mulai dengan berbicara\Ndengan penyembuh spiritual yang dibunuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.22,0:14:15.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka akhirnya kembali.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.06,0:14:18.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nanoka, bagaimana keadaan pria itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.19,0:14:21.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Beberapa saat lalu,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.07,0:14:23.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,dia meninggal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.94,0:14:25.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begitu rupanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.32,0:14:29.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kurasa dia pantas mendapatkannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.82,0:14:30.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.12,0:14:34.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ternyata pria itu membunuh\Npenyembuh spiritual itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.37,0:14:41.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Natsuno dan aku melakukan
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.25,0:14:43.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,ritual pemanggilan roh dan bicara\Ndengan penyembuh spiritual itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.73,0:15:01.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saat aku hampir terbunuh,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.48,0:15:07.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku melempar tanah\Nyang berisi energi spiritualku kepadanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.20,0:15:09.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau mengutuknya?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.32,0:15:13.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku menyerahkan tugasku kepadanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.74,0:15:15.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tugas?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.79,0:15:17.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa dia serius?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.96,0:15:22.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tampaknya, itu cara\Nuntuk memanggilku kemari.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.63,0:15:26.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Memanggilmu kemari?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.42,0:15:29.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Penyembuh spiritual itu bilang bahwa dahulu,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.59,0:15:32.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,seseorang mengajarinya berbagai mantra.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.59,0:15:35.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sebagai balasannya, dia membuat perjanjian
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.85,0:15:39.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,untuk memanggil penyihir Tanah\Npada tanggal yang sudah ditentukan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.52,0:15:43.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saat kami bertanya\Ndengan siapa dia membuat perjanjian,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.73,0:15:46.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,mulutnya menghilang.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.69,0:15:48.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.61,0:15:49.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Untuk membungkamnya?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.61,0:15:52.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau tahu siapa itu, Natsuno?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.12,0:15:55.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.03,0:15:57.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begitu rupanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.04,0:16:00.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Seseorang memancing Natsuno
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.75,0:16:03.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan menghujaninya dengan tanah itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.63,0:16:05.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi siapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.09,0:16:07.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Untuk apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.01,0:16:09.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini masalah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.76,0:16:12.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kedua orang yang terlibat sudah mati.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.43,0:16:15.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita menemui jalan buntu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.89,0:16:21.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Natsuno…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.03,0:16:29.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia pergi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.11,0:16:33.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa itu tidak membuat Natsuno gelisah?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.07,0:16:38.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Natsuno menyembunyikan sesuatu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.33,0:16:43.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau dipikir-pikir,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.00,0:16:46.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,ini sudah tepat 100 tahun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.05,0:16:51.88,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Benarkah?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.97,0:16:54.34,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Kau yakin, Pak?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.59,0:16:56.80,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Ya. Silakan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.85,0:17:03.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dokter Mao, Kamon datang.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.98,0:17:10.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lezat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.90,0:17:13.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nikmatilah sesukamu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.03,0:17:15.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siapa wanita itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.95,0:17:17.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tampaknya dia baru bertemu dengannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.91,0:17:18.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa? Baru saja?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.20,0:17:23.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sesekali, dia akan membawa\Nwanita muda seperti itu
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.29,0:17:25.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan mentraktirnya makan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.21,0:17:27.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.21,0:17:29.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, itu tipenya?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.88,0:17:31.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.38,0:17:33.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,ada apa, Mao?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.59,0:17:39.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku ingin bertanya\Napa yang kau tahu tentang Natsuno.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.81,0:17:42.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Natsuno, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.23,0:17:45.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saat kita meminta bantuan Natsuno
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.19,0:17:48.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,untuk mencapai kuil Shiranui,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.27,0:17:52.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,sepertinya kau\Ntidak sepenuhnya memercayainya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.15,0:17:54.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.36,0:17:55.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau mungkin ingin
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.70,0:17:59.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,tahu soal ini juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.74,0:18:03.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku punya kecurigaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.29,0:18:06.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apakah Natsuno memang pernah
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.17,0:18:09.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,dipanggil ke Goshikido?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.25,0:18:14.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi orang-orang yang dipanggil ke Goshikido
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.51,0:18:16.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,abadi, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.63,0:18:20.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukankah itu sebabnya Natsuno masih hidup?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.22,0:18:24.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu bagian yang belum kupahami.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.52,0:18:29.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sekitar setahun\Nsetelah kehancuran Klan Goko,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.11,0:18:32.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku pergi ke hidenin
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.23,0:18:33.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,tempat kudengar Natsuno tinggal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.44,0:18:35.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hidenin?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.28,0:18:38.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu semacam panti yang dikelola kuil.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.45,0:18:41.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka merawat lansia tanpa keluarga,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.33,0:18:43.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,serta anak-anak dan orang sakit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.87,0:18:47.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku ingin bertanya apa dia tahu\Nke mana Masago pergi
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.83,0:18:49.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,setelah dia menghilang.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.71,0:18:51.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka berdua sepertinya\Nsaling mengenal dengan cukup baik.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.46,0:18:55.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa Natsuno bekerja di hidenin itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.51,0:18:57.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.84,0:19:00.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Natsuno selalu berdedikasi\Nuntuk menciptakan obat Tanah
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.97,0:19:02.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,yang bisa menyembuhkan segala penyakit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.76,0:19:05.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, aku berasumsi dia di sana\Nmemberi orang-orang
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.10,0:19:09.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,obat Tanah yang dia buat\Nselama bersama Klan Goko.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.02,0:19:11.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Natsuno.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.40,0:19:12.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bertahanlah, Nona Natsuno!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.19,0:19:16.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saat aku pergi menemuinya,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.78,0:19:24.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Natsuno sakit parah dan hampir mati.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.79,0:19:29.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi dia hampir tidak bisa bicara.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.25,0:19:33.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh. Kamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.84,0:19:36.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah lama.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.51,0:19:40.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku bertanya apa dia sudah menyempurnakan
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.47,0:19:42.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,obat yang ingin dia ciptakan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.60,0:19:45.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.18,0:19:47.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saat tiba di sini,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.64,0:19:51.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku memberikannya kepada para penghuni.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.90,0:19:54.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi pada akhirnya,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.94,0:19:59.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku tidak bisa menciptakan obat Tanah\Nuntuk menyembuhkan diriku.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.28,0:20:02.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sangat menyesalinya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.70,0:20:06.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Permisi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.83,0:20:07.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tuan Onmyoji.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.83,0:20:13.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dewa wabah?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.46,0:20:15.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.04,0:20:16.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Setiap malam,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.21,0:20:21.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,sesuatu berjongkok\Ndi samping tempat tidur Nona Natsuno.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.09,0:20:24.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku khawatir itu mungkin dewa wabah
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.14,0:20:26.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,yang datang untuk membawa\NNona Natsuno pergi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.56,0:20:32.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Para biksu di kuil\Nberusaha mengusirnya, tapi…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.44,0:20:43.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, aku melindungi Natsuno\Ndengan penghalang
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.78,0:20:45.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan menunggu dewa wabah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.41,0:20:48.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selama dia tetap di dalam penghalang,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.95,0:20:52.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Natsuno tidak akan terlihat oleh dewa wabah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.05,0:21:06.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Seiru, Byakko, Suzaku,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.05,0:21:08.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Genbu, Kochin, Teidai,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.93,0:21:10.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bunno, Santai, Gyokujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.93,0:21:11.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Usir!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.19,0:21:24.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu bukan dewa wabah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.36,0:21:25.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu boneka tanah liat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.03,0:21:29.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tanah lagi…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.62,0:21:31.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pada saat itu…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.51,0:21:43.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Natsuno!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.20,0:22:07.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Natsuno…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.16,0:22:12.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu kali terakhir aku melihatnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.16,0:22:14.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Natsuno tak bisa ditemukan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.25,0:22:19.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa Natsuno melakukan sesuatu\Nyang akan menghancurkan penghalangnya?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.88,0:22:21.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak tahu
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.21,0:22:23.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,apakah dia dimanipulasi
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.92,0:22:25.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,atau dia melakukannya\Natas kemauannya sendiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.80,0:22:29.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tuan Kamon, apa itu\Nsaat kau mendapat bekas luka di matamu?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.76,0:22:32.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya. Itu tak mau hilang.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.22,0:22:36.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka yang dipanggil ke Goshikido
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.89,0:22:39.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,bisa saling melukai dan membunuh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.32,0:22:43.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Namun,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.61,0:22:45.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,mengingat kondisi Natsuno saat itu,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.07,0:22:49.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku tidak percaya\Ndia bisa menggunakan mantra sekuat itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.41,0:22:51.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begini…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.41,0:22:53.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Seseorang yang dipanggil ke Goshikido
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.29,0:22:55.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,makin lemah karena penyakit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.25,0:22:56.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukankah itu agak…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.08,0:22:59.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar. Ada yang tidak beres.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.50,0:23:05.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi faktanya, Natsuno masih hidup.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.47,0:23:10.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini bukan hanya kutukan Goshikido.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.14,0:23:13.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa ada kekuatan lain
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.22,0:23:15.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,yang membuat Natsuno tetap hidup?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.19,0:24:50.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.78,0:24:52.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terlihat seperti mumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.49,0:24:56.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku mendengar rumor\Ntentang rombongan teater keliling.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.24,0:25:00.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tampaknya, mereka mencari desa terpencil
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.62,0:25:02.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan tampil di sana.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.71,0:25:04.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ceritanya menarik, tapi…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.50,0:25:09.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Natsuno,\Nkenapa kau menyelidiki rombongan itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.84,0:25:12.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa ini berhubungan\Ndengan kejadian di aula sembahyang?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.67,0:25:14.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada bekas gigitan di tubuhku!
